        {
          "text": "Lino bantu bakoompolola, alimwi bakalizya myeembo. Nkabela bantu nibakamvwa ijwi lyamweembo, bakoompolola aloompololo lupati. Mpawo bulambo bwamunzi bwakawida ansi mbumu, nkabela bantu bakanjila buyo mumunzi manjilanjila. Mbuboobo mbubakazunda munzi. ",
