                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo abo bakubusi basikulanga nyika bakainka, bakagwisya Rahabu abawisi abanyina abakwabo aboonse mbaakali abo, Basiluzubo lwakwe boonse bakabagwisya, bakabakazika kunze kuzilao nkubakakede ba-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
