        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Rahabu simamambe, aluzubo lwawisi, aboonse mbaakali abo, Joshua wakabavuna, aboobo ucipona akati kaba-Israyeli asunu, nkaambo wakasisa batumwa Joshua mbaakatuma kuyoolanga jeriko,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
